{"steam_appid":1742440,"steam_name":"COP BASTARD","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1742440/141992875/befd7a4c06cdc72e072f560617813c3f31ac5dbd/1793277079/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1793296928","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257484161/ab8d400020ff01db1c0b1d412788c2614e860599/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1793296928","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/d8b1495e8b4b5223b40a62b2babd343abc9e81f6/ss_d8b1495e8b4b5223b40a62b2babd343abc9e81f6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793389651","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/85133034d2c0e8e11418b6026e48c185f7cfd8d1/ss_85133034d2c0e8e11418b6026e48c185f7cfd8d1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793389651","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/8236894500ee25e1c2004b4531290221a950e292/ss_8236894500ee25e1c2004b4531290221a950e292.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793389651","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/cbfaf28e19f244391617a8116b501547f7604a6e/ss_cbfaf28e19f244391617a8116b501547f7604a6e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793389651","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/901e872339a8db6783962801793f46b2a4ea3f7a/ss_901e872339a8db6783962801793f46b2a4ea3f7a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793389651"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/58a0cc6121269499ba8b19108fe3ac35.poster.avif?t=1793389651\" width=790 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/58a0cc6121269499ba8b19108fe3ac35.webm?t=1793389651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/58a0cc6121269499ba8b19108fe3ac35.mp4?t=1793389651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into early 90s Osaka as a tough, no-nonsense detective in <strong>COP BASTARD</strong> - a classic, fast-paced corridor shooter that cuts straight to the chase. No puzzles, no perks, no upgrades, and definitely no time wasted on fancy mechanics. Just raw, relentless action inspired by gritty 90s action movies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/b41217cd0e535d85ea7f0eb2f64681a1.poster.avif?t=1793389651\" width=790 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/b41217cd0e535d85ea7f0eb2f64681a1.webm?t=1793389651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/b41217cd0e535d85ea7f0eb2f64681a1.mp4?t=1793389651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wade through endless waves of Yakuza in tight, intense corridors where every shot counts and survival depends on quick reflexes and guts. Use an arsenal of brutal weapons and even spit in enemies’ faces to assert your dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is tailor-made for fans of old-school shooters who want pure, unfiltered gameplay: no aiming down sights, no character builds, just pure shooting mayhem. If you crave high-octane, corridor-based FPS action with zero filler, COP BASTARD delivers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/ba31fb7cd2e729036583cf39213a7a9d.poster.avif?t=1793389651\" width=790 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/ba31fb7cd2e729036583cf39213a7a9d.webm?t=1793389651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742440/extras/ba31fb7cd2e729036583cf39213a7a9d.mp4?t=1793389651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with a modern engine yet dripping with retro atmosphere, the game throws you into an immersive world full of gore, pounding music, and chaotic combat. Get ready to run, shoot, and spit your way through the criminal underworld - and don’t expect anything less than non-stop, brutal fun.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> with a clock frequency of 2.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 Gb Video Memory, capable of Shader Model 2.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 3.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 Gb Video Memory, capable of Shader Model 2.0+<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie"],"developers":["targim."],"publishers":["Retrovibe"],"release_date":"Oct 29, 2026"}